{"id":"vod_bf_35889","vodId":"35889","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我不是说了能力要平均值么！","name_cn":"我不是说了能力要平均值么！","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/c32028fb40540948b981a04b54d00891.jpg"},"summary":"栗原海里（和气杏未 配音）是一位非常善良的高中生，因为在所有方面都比别人强一点点，所以海里的高中生活过得并不是那么的顺利，周围的人总是和她保持着距离，这让海里倍感孤独。一场意外中，海里遭遇了事故，转生来到了异世界中，她向神明许愿，希望在这里自己能够成为一个所有数值都是平均值的普通少女。　　口嫌体正直的傲娇少女烈娜（德井青空 配音）、经常被误会是男性的女骑士梅维丝（内村史子 配音）、身材娇小个性温和的珀琳（田泽茉纯 配音），在这里，海里很快就结交了一群朋友们。随着时间的推移，海里渐渐发现，绝对平均的数值对于她来说，竟然成为了一种优势。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:23:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wobushishuoliaonengliyaopingjunzhime/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"n